KV v2 has three delete levels: soft (DELETE data/:path, POST delete/:path), destroy a version (PUT destroy/:path), and key+all-versions (DELETE metadata/:path). delete_secret implements only level 3, the irreversible one, under a name that reads like level 1. Add the soft delete / undelete / destroy methods, and make the POD state which level each performs.
